stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Prepared: store payload before the target commit
    Prepared --> Waiting: commit proof missing
    Waiting --> Prepared: check later
    Waiting --> Dead: unconfirmed after the deadline
    Prepared --> Ready: commit proof present
    Ready --> Running: lease + memory budget
    Running --> Retry: temporary error
    Retry --> Ready: backoff expired
    Running --> Dead: permanent / attempts exhausted
    Running --> Delivered: external success stored
    Delivered --> Cleanup: clean up receipt + job
    Cleanup --> Delivered: cleanup failed
    Cleanup --> [*]: done
    Note right of Running: An external success before the update can be repeated after a crash
